{"parse": {"title": "无路可返-01", "pageid": 140187, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E5%90%8D%E8%80%85%C2%B7%E6%97%A0%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%94\" title=\"无名者·无路可返\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">无路可返-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%B7%AF%E5%8F%AF%E8%BF%94-02\" title=\"无路可返-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">无路可返</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.87.AA.E6.88.91.E6.BA.B6.E8.A7.A3.E9.85.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"自我溶解酶\">自我溶解酶</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 自我溶解酶</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Mental Autolysis</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你可以放轻松，这只是一次心理诊察。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康复中心的诊疗室，人工梦游治疗师没有看向面前坐姿端正的客人，专心调整着仪器。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>请放心，小梅斯梅尔小姐，我很理解你的难处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>一个反复加入重塑之手的人难以得到信任，特别是她还两次戴上了面具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>除了基金会的机密，我可以回答你的任何问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>摄像头的光线对准了受问者，将她的瞳孔照成了金色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不，我不是在审问你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我们的目的是确保重塑之手的面具没有给你留下什么危险的后遗症。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你不用每个问题都如实回答我，当成一场聊天就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人工梦游治疗师确认了三回瞳孔的成像无误后，拿起了手中的题册。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2\"><img alt=\"2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png/600px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png/900px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4e/Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png/1200px-Cg-2_8_bg_xueyuanshichang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>第一个问题，你正赤足在雪原中行走，面前是一望无际的白色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这是什么关于南极事件的暗示吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不，这只是习题的一部分，旨在测试你的感情起伏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你感到饥饿，因为你已经三天没有进食了，这时有一只雪兔来到你的脚下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>它似乎把你认成了同类，蜷缩在你的脚边，和你分享着温暖。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>这可真残忍……我想为了生存，我会抓住这只亲近人的兔子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_haimian\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_haimian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png/1200px-Cg-2_7_at_haimian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>下一个问题，你正在海上享受日光浴，突然升起的大浪却将你卷到了未知的海域……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>提问者的吐词中没有感情，受问者的感情则标准得像是教科书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>问答声在诊室内无间歇地反复，摄像机的快门闪烁约四十次后，诊室迎来了短暂的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>哎……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我的回答很糟糕吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>并不坏，你的回答和你表现出的情绪都在偏差范围内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>但是都过于标准，正常人做不到在面对同类问题时保证所有微反应一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>你是对的，我受过的教育要求我做到这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>也许是我最近太累了，通常我会在表情之间加入一些微小的变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>如果我在这份诊断报告上签字，每个部门都会怀疑我造假。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你必须用真实的情绪来回答我的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我明白你的意思，小梅斯梅尔小姐，你真的难倒我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我受过的教育就是如此，这恐怕像呼吸习惯一样难以改变。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>不过也许我可以试着用不同的情绪回答同类的问题？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这同样没有意义……在伪造报告时可能有用，但我不会允许。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>请你躺到床上去，诊察改在人工梦游中进行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>没问题，我的记忆随时向你开放。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>受问者坦然地躺下，像是要迎接一场美梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……人工梦游，开始。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_at_jianggushi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_at_jianggushi1\"><img alt=\"2_1_at_jianggushi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_1_at_jianggushi1.png/600px-Cg-2_1_at_jianggushi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_1_at_jianggushi1.png/900px-Cg-2_1_at_jianggushi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_1_at_jianggushi1.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_at_jianggushi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>那么，我们从哪儿开始呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你在和我说话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>当然，这里应该没有其他人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>按照目前设置的睡眠深度，你不应该保有清醒意识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我受过非常严密的教育，以防在说梦话时暴露机密。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>清醒梦不是值得夸赞的能力，它可能只是精神分裂的前兆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>不必担心我，这个症状已经持续好几年了，它没有造成任何问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>……我还能在神秘学家身上期待什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>总之，我会如实记录你的异常表现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>请从你能想起的童年开始回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>那让我们从第一防线学校开始，我的母校。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"diyifangxianxuexiao\"><img alt=\"diyifangxianxuexiao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/600px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/900px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/1200px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑暗中浮现的首先是黑白格子地砖铺就的教室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>今天是你们正式在第一防线学校上课的第一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>我已经了解了你们的信息，但我希望你们每个人都做一个自我介绍。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>这能够帮助你们互相认识并了解自我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>现在，按照座位次序开始点名，点到名的就站起来介绍自己的神秘术和姓名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多数拘谨的孩童挨个起身，坐下，桌椅和地面碰撞的声音有节奏地响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>教员看着这一切，满意地点头，直到坐在窗边的女孩利落地起身，却没有制造任何多余的声音，交响曲被突然中断。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柯拉：</div><div>我的名字是柯拉，我的神秘术是……制造火焰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我还记得，我在入学时骗了教员，说自己的神秘术是制造火焰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>一直到我第三次找借口躲过神秘术小测，教员们才注意到问题所在。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_bg_30.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_bg_30\"><img alt=\"3_7_bg_30\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-3_7_bg_30.png/600px-Cg-3_7_bg_30.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-3_7_bg_30.png/900px-Cg-3_7_bg_30.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Cg-3_7_bg_30.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_bg_30.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>柯拉，你知道我为什么要找你谈话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柯拉：</div><div>我知道的，老师，因为我是个神秘学家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>……你是个乖孩子，作为神秘学家来到世上不是你的错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>你的同学们也都是神秘学家，而你有着比他们都优异的成绩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>就算是在人类学校中，你也可以做一个优等生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>我知道，胡乱使用神秘术是不好的，这是我教导你们的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>但我希望你学会控制它，而不是一味地抑制它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>你的其他各项成绩都很好，只要按我教的做，在下次测试时证明你的神秘术控制能力——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-506201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>我就可以申请给你跳级，你不想早点毕业，去外面的世界看看吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>结果下一次测验时，我还是沉默地站在操场中央，一动不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>学校这才开始怀疑我并不是会喷火的柯拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我从未听说第一防线学校有过这样一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>像你这样的情况会引起大轰动，为什么没有人提起过你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>基金会消除了我的档案，毕业生名单中没有我的名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我的脸被从每一张集体照片上抹去，拥有过去对间谍来说只是破绽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我对你的境遇表示同情，但这还是说不通……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>请不要在意。毕竟这可能不是我的记忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你的意思是？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>最近我的长期记忆有些混乱，太多人的过去混在我脑子里了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我试着回忆了几个同学的名字，但只想起了约翰、史密斯，还有多伊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>看来这段记忆确实是个误会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>这代表你有精神病，我很肯定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>嗯……这一段，这一段似乎是真实的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>记忆的景象再度模糊，于黑暗中重新塑形。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我应该只是个来自冰岛的普通女孩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>生活中最大的乐趣是在奶油泡芙日用纸棍打父母的屁股来换取点心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>第二大乐趣是和他们一起去百老汇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>不好意思，百老汇？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>噢！真是抱歉，冰岛应该没有百老汇？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-huaerjie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"huaerjie\"><img alt=\"huaerjie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-huaerjie.png/600px-Cg-huaerjie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-huaerjie.png/900px-Cg-huaerjie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-huaerjie.png/1200px-Cg-huaerjie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>请让我再更正一次，我是在纽约长大的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>又或者是旧金山？我记得家附近有很大的唐人街。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>可惜我的中文不是很好，在唐人街的餐馆点餐时总是点错份量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>加了奇米丘里酱的烤肉虽然好吃，可我一个人也吃不完七份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>奇米丘里酱不属于中餐，它是阿根廷的特产。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>你是说……我的故乡在阿根廷？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_6_bg_jietou\"><img alt=\"2_6_bg_jietou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/600px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/900px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png/1200px-Cg-2_6_bg_jietou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>哎……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人工梦游治疗师无奈的叹息打断了回忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你的童年回忆全是漏洞，我已经了解了这一点，这就够了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>继续和童年纠缠只会增加你的精神负担。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我建议你向前看，从能够确定的记忆开始回想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>确凿的部分？当然，我当然记得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>不管童年怎么样，从那一天开始的记忆我不曾遗忘过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">无名者：</div><div>我遇到外星人的那一天……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>什么？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "无路可返-01"}}